---
source: crates/rune-config/src/schema.rs
description: "no `scripts` key, and a `scripts` that is a list"
expression: "format!(\"{missing}\\n\\n---\\n\\n{unusable}\")"
---
the config has no `scripts`

every script rune can run is an entry in it:

  export default {
    scripts: {
      dev: { command: "vite" },
    },
  };

---

the config's `scripts` must be an object; found an array

`scripts` maps each name to what that name runs:

  scripts: {
    dev: { command: "vite" },
  }
